      "widgets_values": [
        "dunhuang,An Asian woman with an elegant and layered high bun,exuding grace and classical charm through its graceful lines. Her eyebrows are delicately thin and elongated,in line with the classical style; her eye makeup is understated,subtly enhancing the contours of her eyes to create a deep-set look; her lip color is chosen in a low-key and soft tone,giving her overall makeup a clear and natural appearance,highlighting her classical and gentle temperament. The outfit is mainly made of delicate and luxurious metal materials,paired with crystal-clear jewelry,with complex and exquisite designs,featuring dynamic tassels and other decorations,adding a sense of liveliness and ethereality that complements the entire look. She wears a white long dress with off-shoulder design showcasing her delicate shoulder lines. The top is adorned with exquisite jewelry accessories that echo the hair ornaments; the bottom is loose and flowing,with long ribbons fluttering in the wind,fully displaying an ethereal and dynamic aura. Holding a lotus prop gently in one hand and placing the other on her chest,her posture slightly twisted,presenting an S-curve,exuding an elegant and composed demeanor,as if performing a classical dance,radiating a tranquil,dignified,and lively temperament.,"
      ]
